    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "The youth of Cali, Colombia can gather together and talk about themselves and the issues that are important to their lives in a unique space called Punto D. Punto D was developed by Team El Pais who saw the need for a space to facilitate face to face interactions especially for young people. Punto D is a space where young people can interact with news stories on a display, meet other people their age and research certain topics such as employment opportunities. They can have an immersive shared experience with information and each other while still being in the same room with their peers.",
            "type": "abstract",
            "identifier": [],
            "note": [],
            "appliesTo": []
        },
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "Londono, Tatiana Salazar; Lin, Yon; Alvarez, Luis Fernando; Belmonte, Peter; Mukundarajan, Haripriya and Botero, Jorge. (2012). Punto D. Stanford Digital Repository. Available at: http://purl.stanford.edu/kz399yh9465",
